@startuml TokenFlow
autonumber
hide unlinked
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign direction
skinparam ParticipantPadding 20
skinparam BoxPadding 10

skinparam sequence {
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #A9DCDF
    LifeLineBorderColor #368E92
    ArrowColor #Black
}
actor User

actor "ERP Admin" as Admin
participant "ERP App" as ERP
participant "Auth App (Keycloak)" as Auth


Admin++
Admin -> ERP : Request App token (using Erp token)
ERP++
ERP -> Auth : Ask for a token for this user,\nthrough the tenant's mobile client
Auth -> ERP : Return long-lived token (30 days)
ERP -> ERP : Save the token with its expiry, for the POS app
ERP -> Admin : Provide token (store for future use)

@enduml
